      <h1 class="title">Behavioral Verification Engine</h1>
      <p class="dek">An independent checker that catches when an AI code-migration agent silently changes business logic — instead of trusting the same model to grade its own work. This document is the complete build plan: architecture, workflow, week-by-week checkpoints, the diff engine's decision logic, and the CI gate that ships it.</p>
