            <li>Second and third pattern types: a stateful validator, an async data-fetch-and-transform path.</li>
            <li>Per-model drift-rate dashboard across migration runs, mirroring the self-review study's per-model bimodal breakdown.</li>
            <li>Corpus diffing between CI runs to catch cases where a spec change silently narrows coverage.</li>
